WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.830
Save the quality and create its first costing
together.

2
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:12.353
Review the assumptions, then save a reusable
recipe and a fixed costing snapshot.

3
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.686
Find the fabric in Saved Qualities.

4
00:00:17.926 --> 00:00:21.509
Open its rate editor to review the current yarn
prices.

5
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.257
Change the warp rate to one hundred and thirty
rupees per kilogram.

6
00:00:29.497 --> 00:00:32.677
Review the cost impact, then save and apply.

7
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:45.113
Select the saved fabric again to restore its
construction and costing inputs,

8
00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:47.667
without entering everything from scratch.
